Regional Apparatus that has the duty to assist the Regent in policy formulation and administrative coordination of the implementation of regional apparatus duties and administrative services. b. Regional apparatus that has the duty to assist the Regent in fostering and supervising the implementation of governmental affairs which are the authority of the Region and

